 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "b8d88387de13e19a1f4038e23a2331842160ded9899db76c415497d552b94f65",
   "seconds": 2.474,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "1303c6acdc006f34740b16d33ea231fe7a43f6cfb67b2cde36f0bbbcb8f4b42d",
   "seconds": 3.563,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "840914c74f77ea23315895fef2a38ff44cbc279cc25435c4d4c1c0348be85c16",
   "seconds": 4.208,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "76a0e349c75f757f3c634a43210d780a7fc2b1b56d46b5f6a7886138abe49d61",
   "seconds": 4.529,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "c59f9adc1039b3b8c028ed1ef0ed4844c3bf19137907df26f9d1f41a436e7156",
   "seconds": 3.322,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "5012958a8c7076e04de654a0fe06a85d7d90351ea70e5b5c4b3784ff591965a6",
   "seconds": 4.561,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "7aea38297bc5eb2ccdab2d05aeeea8730d489f55b9ee7823658af1aa7516d1af",
   "seconds": 5.848,
   "pause_ms": 450
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "76997e0033703da0e7d521b7369dffddc6302e0dda2f1005aba4353f0f106baf",
   "seconds": 2.756,
   "pause_ms": 315
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "837752e82f52df4e8e6508257554679e4f124b089bc7abf1c5aa104c3a69fff0",
   "seconds": 3.507,
   "pause_ms": 450
  }
 ],
